celluloid (0.28-2) unstable; urgency=high

  * Team upload.
  * d/control:
    - Remove build-dependency libdisplay-info-dev (Closes: #1101845)
    NOTE: Previously missing in libmpv-dev causes FTBFS in this package
    - Add build-dependency desktop-file-utils optionally required
    NOTE: The desktop-file-validate shows as missing in build logs, but not
    causes FTBFS
    The desktop-file-validate program is a tool to validate desktop entry
    files according to the Desktop Entry specification

